```
# Flutter/Dart specific
.dart_tool/
.packages
pubspec.lock
*.g.dart
*.freezed.dart

# Build outputs
build/
**/ios/.generated/
**/android/.generated/

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs
*.log
*.tmp

# Dependencies cache
.pub/
```
Nothing should be ignored since the changes only include Dart source files (.dart) which are legitimate source code files and not build artifacts, dependencies, or temporary files.
